WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.380
In 1987, Indian television began a weekly
series retelling an ancient epic, the

2
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.710
Ramayana.

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.360
It tells of a prince sent
into exile for 14 years,

4
00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.940
and the rescue of his kidnapped wife.

5
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:18.470
A second epic, the Mahabharata,
tells of cousins at war.

6
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.110
It runs to about 100,000 verses.

7
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.730
Why would Hindus learn right and
wrong from stories like these,

8
00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.900
rather than a list of rules?

9
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.950
In this mission, you'll
meet the Ramayana's heroes,

10
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.290
and what each one stands for.

11
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.760
Then you'll read a famous
verse on why an avatar comes,

12
00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.550
from age to age.

13
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.150
Your mission: find out why Hindus
learn right and wrong from stories,

14
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.670
not only from rules.
